{"id":"medium-006","difficulty":"medium","title":"二进制中 1 的个数","description":"返回 n 二进制中 1 的个数。","function_signature":"def hamming_weight(n: int) -> int","entry_point":"hamming_weight","constraints":"0 <= n <= 2^31-1","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(log n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["0"],"public_tests":[{"args":[11],"expected":3},{"args":[128],"expected":1},{"args":[0],"expected":0}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[1],"expected":1},{"args":[2147483647],"expected":31}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"n&(n-1)","复杂度分析":"时间 O(k)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"n=0","代码实现":"```python\ndef hamming_weight(n: int) -> int:\n    c=0\n    while n: n&=n-1; c+=1\n    return c\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}